{* The tool is a Vue island (assets/spisovka/full.js). The server contributes
   the starting data only - court codelist and the prefill from GET params -
   so the form exists in exactly one implementation. Deliberately no no-JS
   fallback here: a second, server-rendered version of this form would drift
   away from the live one, which is worse than requiring JavaScript. *}
{varType array $state}

{block content}
<div class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl sm:mt-16">
    <h1 class="mb-8 text-center">
        {include logo from '../@brand.latte', class: 'inline-block h-14! w-auto sm:h-16!'}
    </h1>

    <div class="card border border-base-300 bg-base-100 shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body">
            <div id="spisovka-app" data-state="{$state}">
                <noscript>
                    <p class="text-sm">
                        Váš prohlížeč nepodporuje JavaScript, bez něho bohužel tato aplikace nefunguje.
                    </p>
                </noscript>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
